        "original_id": "641d46e3-7453-510a-aa86-d3bbb0a4b077",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bailee Madison, Dennis Dugan, Allan Loeb, Timothy Dowling, Adam Sandler, Jennifer Aniston, Nicole Kidman, Nick Swardson, Brooklyn Decker\n- Works: Don't Be Afraid of the Dark, Just Go with It, Parental Guidance\n- Roles: Maggie, Harper Simmons\n- Topics: film credits, cast and production\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, \"Just Go with It\" was released as an American romantic comedy film.\n- \"Just Go with It\" was directed by Dennis Dugan.\n- \"Just Go with It\" was written by Allan Loeb and Timothy Dowling.\n- Adam Sandler starred in \"Just Go with It\" and also co-produced it.\n- Jennifer Aniston, Nicole Kidman, Nick Swardson, and Brooklyn Decker starred in \"Just Go with It\".\n- Bailee Madison appeared in the horror film \"Don't Be Afraid of the Dark\".\n- Bailee Madison played Maggie in \"Just Go with It\".\n- Bailee Madison played Harper Simmons in \"Parental Guidance\".",
